  "instructions": [
    "Preheat the oven to 400°F (200°C) and the skillet to medium-high heat.",
    "Add 1 tablespoon of oil to the skillet and cook the beef brisket until browned.",
    "Add the onion to the skillet and cook until softened.",
    "Add the garlic to the skillet and cook for 1 minute.",
    "Add the frozen french fries to the skillet and cook until golden brown.",
    "In a separate bowl, mix the shredded cheese with the flour.",
    "Add the cheese mixture on top of the beef mixture and cook until the cheese is melted.",
    "Fold the hash in thirds and cook for an additional 5 minutes.",
    "Serve hot and enjoy.",
    "Garnish with chopped fresh parsley if desired."
